          "rating": 5,
          "description": "As a proud parent of an MBA graduate from the Ross School of Business, it was a privilege to visit the campus. The school offers an inspiring learning environment with outstanding facilities, collaborative spaces, and a vibrant academic culture. Seeing where my son studied gave me a deep appreciation for the quality of education and the opportunities Ross provides. A truly world-class business school.",
